OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear skies to start the night,
OL,7,Fhowever cloud will increase from the
OL,8,Fsouth soon after dusk, with a risk of
OL,9,Fpatchy rain during the early hours.
OL,10,FSoutheasterly winds freshening
OL,11,Fovernight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FA blustery day ahead with
OL,14,Fstrongest gusts around coasts. Cloudy
OL,15,Finitially with an odd spot of rain,
OL,16,Falthough brighter spells possible
OL,17,Fthrough the afternoon. Heavy
OL,18,Fpersistent rain arriving towards dusk.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
